{"about_the_game":"In this game, you follow an eternal being who got bored in heaven and tries to make their way back into the world of the living. <br>The being is seeking for an adventure and even risks eternal live on order to feel the effects of time and the transience of life once more.<br>In order to return to earth it has to pass the path of trials... a path filled with traps, difficult jumps, and hidden secrets.<br><br>The game is a unique combination of a first-person platformer and a light-hearted exploration game with an almost philosophical story-telling. <br>It is highly stylized and surprises with breathtaking environments, a surreal world full of beauty and grace, and a couple of small environmental puzzles that blend perfectly into the peaceful yet stunning environments. <br><br>Will you be able to make it back to earth? <br>Find it out.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Here are some of the features of the game:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Fast-paced parkour action<br></li><li> An interesting background story<br></li><li> 11 unique worlds with 5 levels each <br></li><li> Countless traps and difficult jumps<br></li><li> Hidden paths and secret achievements<br></li><li> The feeling of smooth and fast speed while bouncing through levels<br></li><li> Awesome soundtrack</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"World 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1834580/e2a10a557c7543a779935d2290cccaebef0bc06f.jpg"},{"name":"World 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1834580/e2a10a557c7543a779935d2290cccaebef0bc06f.jpg"},{"name":"World 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1834580/cfeffe8ec791c683832186a9ebbde05a126caa78.jpg"},{"name":"World 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1834580/e2a10a557c7543a779935d2290cccaebef0bc06f.jpg"},{"name":"World 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamc